{"repositoryId":1290142982,"availability":"available","full":"Neevis01/Socrates-AI","name":"Socrates-AI","description":"A digital philosophy sparring partner powered by Gemini 3.5 Flash.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-05T16:19:06Z","updated":"2026-07-20T07:36:51Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":" https://socrates-ai-kyy7.onrender.com","topics":["gemini-api","javascript","nodejs","pwa","sqlite"],"demo":"https://socrates-ai-kyy7.onrender.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:22.384Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:22.384Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:22.384Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T21:46:22.384Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Hi! I'm a 19-year-old business administration (BWL) student who has an unhealthy passion for philosophy. During my semester break, I wanted to build something real that connects my interests — so I created Socrates.","Instead of being another boring AI assistant that blindly agrees with everything you say or writes your essays for you, this app does the exact opposite. It uses the strict Socratic Method to question your assumptions, poke holes in your logic, and drive you slightly crazy until you find the answers within yourself.","Think of it as a conversational sparring partner for your brain."],"features":["The Socratic Roast Engine: Powered by Google's Gemini API, fine-tuned to never give you direct advice, comfort you, or agree with you. It only asks painful, deep, contextual counter-questions.","The \"I Don't Get It\" Panic Button: If Socrates goes full ancient-greek-nerd mode and you lose the plot, just hit the button. The backend deterministically injects a control signal so he briefly drops the act, explains…","Long-Term Memory: Built with an SQLite database. It doesn't just remember your last sentence like a goldfish; it transforms the entire chat history so Gemini understands the whole philosophical arc.","No Ghosting: Your conversations are permanently saved locally. You can close the browser, restart your laptop, or contemplate your existence overnight — your chats stay right there in the sidebar.","Mobile Friendly: Optimized layouts and a slick dark-mode UI with gold accents. Perfect for having existential crises on your smartphone while lying on the couch."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Neevis01/Socrates-AI/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"82085d538143ec8be889596d6e3022b1ef2ac2cd48191b934281dce77f6e916b","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:22.600Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:22.600Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Hi! I'm a 19-year-old business administration (BWL) student who has an unhealthy passion for philosophy. During my semester break, I wanted to build something real that connects my interests — so I created Socrates.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Neevis01/Socrates-AI/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Mobile Friendly: Optimized layouts and a slick dark-mode UI with gold accents. Perfect for having existential crises on your smartphone while lying on the couch.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Neevis01/Socrates-AI/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"82085d538143ec8be889596d6e3022b1ef2ac2cd48191b934281dce77f6e916b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Neevis01/Socrates-AI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:22.601Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-07-20T07:36:51Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Neevis01/Socrates-AI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:22.601Z","hash":"82085d538143ec8be889596d6e3022b1ef2ac2cd48191b934281dce77f6e916b","originalBytes":6197,"storedBytes":6197,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","socrates","gemini","server","app","backend","just","live","philosophical","when","bash","button","chat","like","logic","panic","via","classification","d